          "english_quote": "The house/clothing and virgins imagery is retained;",
          "issue": "The note claims retention of house imagery, but the selected source contains clothing and virgins imagery, not house imagery. This introduces an unsupported description of this unit.",
          "suggested_revision": "Replace this clause with “The clothing and virgins imagery is retained.” Any reference to house imagery elsewhere should be explicitly identified as contextual and supported by a locator. Review the revised note before acceptance.",
